1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:02,300
This ancient human was an adult,

2
00:00:02,300 --> 00:00:03,675
not a child.

3
00:00:04,175 --> 00:00:06,975
One individual of Homo floresiensis,

4
00:00:06,975 --> 00:00:08,738
discovered on the Indonesian

5
00:00:08,738 --> 00:00:11,125
island of Flores, is estimated

6
00:00:11,125 --> 00:00:12,263
to have stood about three and

7
00:00:12,263 --> 00:00:13,775
a half feet tall.

8
00:00:14,225 --> 00:00:16,138
These small-bodied humans had

9
00:00:16,138 --> 00:00:17,788
a distinctive combination of

10
00:00:17,788 --> 00:00:19,550
anatomical traits.

11
00:00:19,550 --> 00:00:20,875
They were not simply modern

12
00:00:20,875 --> 00:00:22,950
