13
00:00:23,550 --> 00:00:25,287
Their evolutionary origins

14
00:00:25,287 --> 00:00:26,850
remain debated.

15
00:00:26,850 --> 00:00:28,750
Island environments can reshape

16
00:00:28,750 --> 00:00:30,600
populations, but that does

17
00:00:30,600 --> 00:00:32,225
not settle the exact route

18
00:00:32,225 --> 00:00:33,575
